        <summary>Certificate sent from the server is ignored.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Certificate sent from the server is ignored. Only Extensible Authentication Protocol (EAP) is used to authenticate the server. EAP_ONLY_AUTH payload is added to IKE_AUTH request if supported.</para>
